# Reference KPIs (golden master) for IAPWS-IF97 region 3.
#
# THE FIRST FOUR OPERATIONS' ROWS ARE THE PUBLISHED NUMBERS, NOT A RECORDING:
# p, h, u, s, cp and w of the three region-3 verification states are copied
# digit for digit from Wagner et al., J. Eng. Gas Turbines Power 122 (2000)
# 150-182, Table A10 (= IAPWS R7-97(2012), Table 33), read from the paper's
# page image.  reltol 1e-8 is the printed precision: half a unit in the ninth
# significant digit is at most 5e-9 relative.  r3_T650_p25p58MPa is the first
# state again from its printed PRESSURE, and its rho row pins the backward
# density to the printed 500 kg/m3.
#
# The rows from drum_water on are SELF-RECORDED (2026-11-04, this build):
# they pin that the answer has not moved, never that it is right -- no
# printed value exists at those states.  The engine's own tripwire is
# IF97::verify(), which every steamTables run executes and which refuses the
# run above 1e-8.
